## RelationType: 使能

来源 IRI：`https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/enables`。来源定义：a capability enables another capability only if realization of the first capability implies realization of the second capability。此 BKN 投影使用 `enables_target_id` 保存目标实体 ID。

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| capability | capability | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| enables_target_id | entity_id |
